354 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Frogs play an important role in maintaining the balance of ecosystems and are under threat today. Each year, Save The Frogs Day is celebrated globally on the 28th of April to raise awareness about the role of frogs in the environment and their conservation. The Nature Study and Conservation Club \(NSCC\) from the Department of Zoology of Jagannath University celebrated the 16th Annual Save The Frogs Day 2024 on 16th May 2024. The event was celebrated at Amlitola Government Primary School, Madhupur, Tangail which is located just beside the Madhupur National Park, Bangladesh. Students from local communities including the indigenous Garo community living beside the forest, attend this school.)
/E (Frogs play an important role in maintaining the balance of ecosystems and are under threat today. Each year, Save The Frogs Day is celebrated globally on the 28th of April to raise awareness about the role of frogs in the environment and their conservation. The Nature Study and Conservation Club \(NSCC\) from the Department of Zoology of Jagannath University celebrated the 16th Annual Save The Frogs Day 2024 on 16th May 2024. The event was celebrated at Amlitola Government Primary School, Madhupur, Tangail which is located just beside the Madhupur National Park, Bangladesh. Students from local communities including the indigenous Garo community living beside the forest, attend this school.)
