431 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (While slogging through the wild wonderland, we were greeted by towering trees adorned with lichens, mosses, mushrooms, and orchids, seemingly swinging in the wind. I couldn't resist being nosy and peeking into the secret world of tadpole life. Those little guys were having the time of their lives, jiggling and gulping air. They swam around like Olympic swimmers, dodging rocks and each other like pros, while we shone our torches over them. It was a wild, wild night out in the swamp. I recall a vivid moment amidst the pouring rain, when the bone-chilling wind turned relentless, and a multitude of bloodthirsty creatures \(leeches\) clung to our leech socks. We hurriedly made our way towards our car.  In that rush, a peculiar sound that mingled with the calls of bush frogs and the songs of the cicadas intrigued us. )
/E (While slogging through the wild wonderland, we were greeted by towering trees adorned with lichens, mosses, mushrooms, and orchids, seemingly swinging in the wind. I couldn't resist being nosy and peeking into the secret world of tadpole life. Those little guys were having the time of their lives, jiggling and gulping air. They swam around like Olympic swimmers, dodging rocks and each other like pros, while we shone our torches over them. It was a wild, wild night out in the swamp. I recall a vivid moment amidst the pouring rain, when the bone-chilling wind turned relentless, and a multitude of bloodthirsty creatures \(leeches\) clung to our leech socks. We hurriedly made our way towards our car.  In that rush, a peculiar sound that mingled with the calls of bush frogs and the songs of the cicadas intrigued us. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
