441 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The moment she got there, the male initiated an amplexus \(the position in which frogs and toads mate, in which the male fertilises the eggs as the female lays them\) with the female, which lasted for no more than a couple of minutes. Apparently, after disengaging the male, in an instant, the female suspended her eggs on the rocky surfaces, approximately four inches above the turbulent water flow through the crevices, securing the future of their kind with skilful precision. But in mere seconds, the couple disappeared.)
/E (The moment she got there, the male initiated an amplexus \(the position in which frogs and toads mate, in which the male fertilises the eggs as the female lays them\) with the female, which lasted for no more than a couple of minutes. Apparently, after disengaging the male, in an instant, the female suspended her eggs on the rocky surfaces, approximately four inches above the turbulent water flow through the crevices, securing the future of their kind with skilful precision. But in mere seconds, the couple disappeared.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
