444 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (My adventures off the tourist map, delving into nature's mysteries, brought on inexplicable feelings of wonder. On one occasion at the research location, during a late-night session, we were standing beneath a tree, anticipating the call of the Dattatreya night frog. Unexpectedly, we were startled by the sight of an Asian palm civet indulging in palm kernels with a fluffy tail. As I gazed upwards with my head torch, memories from twelve years ago returned, where I last met this creature beneath the stars with my father amidst coffee shrubs. Seeing it again that night in its natural habitat left an indelible impression on me, ranking among the most unforgettable sights I have ever beheld.)
/E (My adventures off the tourist map, delving into nature's mysteries, brought on inexplicable feelings of wonder. On one occasion at the research location, during a late-night session, we were standing beneath a tree, anticipating the call of the Dattatreya night frog. Unexpectedly, we were startled by the sight of an Asian palm civet indulging in palm kernels with a fluffy tail. As I gazed upwards with my head torch, memories from twelve years ago returned, where I last met this creature beneath the stars with my father amidst coffee shrubs. Seeing it again that night in its natural habitat left an indelible impression on me, ranking among the most unforgettable sights I have ever beheld.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
