/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Sea snakes spend their entire lives underwater but often get unintentionally caught in fishing nets and end up on fish landing sites. Gaurav spotted this Shaw's sea snake as a by-catch on one such fish landing site on the Mumbai shores. Unlike sea kraits, they give birth to live young instead of laying eggs on land. Given the lack of awareness and misconceptions that lead to their deaths, Gaurav suggests an urgent need to study sea snakes thoroughly along India's west coast.)
/E (Sea snakes spend their entire lives underwater but often get unintentionally caught in fishing nets and end up on fish landing sites. Gaurav spotted this Shaw's sea snake as a by-catch on one such fish landing site on the Mumbai shores. Unlike sea kraits, they give birth to live young instead of laying eggs on land. Given the lack of awareness and misconceptions that lead to their deaths, Gaurav suggests an urgent need to study sea snakes thoroughly along India's west coast.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
