/ActualText (HerpBuzz, our monthly newsletter, aims to foster public engagement in the field of herpetology and create a community of naturalists who can collaborate to expand our knowledge of Indian herpetofauna. HerpBuzz serves as a herpetological bulletin board as well as a platform for our readers to share their experiences & insights. We believe that HerpBuzz will be a great resource for anybody interested in reptiles and amphibians.)
